Amana = (i:1) (t:name) (c:mountain) (w:Amana) (d:mountain in the Anti-Lebanon range, named together with Senir and Hermon) (q:draft)
amanin = (i:1) (t:conj) (w:because) (d:Because, a spelling of <manin> after <ahih>; {ahih amanin}, usually written {ahih manin}, means because it is so.) (b:manin) (q:draft, low confidence)
