amasa = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:first/at first/at the beginning/before) (d:First or at first, <masa> written together with the prefix <a>; {amasa bangin} means as before and {amasa sanga} means than the first.) (a:anung/nunungin) (b:masa) (q:draft)
