Amau = (i:1) (t:pron) (w:their/they/them) (d:Third person plural, <amau> written with a capital at the start of a sentence or a line of verse; before a noun it means their, and before <kiangah> it means to them.) (s:Amaute) (b:amau) (r:45.11.27) (q:draft)
amaute = (i:2) (t:pron) (w:them) (d:Third person plural pronoun as the object of a verb or before <tawh>, with, and <kiangah>, to.) (b:amau)
