anoth = (t:see) <Beth-anoth>
anpal = (i:1) (t:n) (w:firstfruits/first grain) (d:<an>, grain, with {pal}, first to ripen: the first of the grain harvest, given as an offering; {anpal ni} is the day of firstfruits) (q:draft)
