Beeri = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Beeri) (d:name of two men: the Hittite father of Judith, wife of Esau, and the father of the prophet Hosea) (r:1.26.34/28.1.1)
Beerlahairoi = (i:1) (t:name) (c:well) (w:Beer-lahai-roi/Beer Lahai Roi) (d:well between Kadesh and Bered where the angel of the Lord met Hagar; Isaac later lived near it) (r:1.16.14/1.24.62)
Beeroth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Beeroth) (d:town of the Gibeonites, allotted to the tribe of Benjamin) (r:6.18.25/10.23.37)
Beersheba = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Beersheba) (d:town with a well in the far south of Judah, in the Negev, where Abraham and Isaac lived) (r:13.4.28/1.26.33)
