Benoni = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ben-oni/Ben-Oni) (d:the name the dying Rachel gave her son, whom his father Jacob named Benjamin) (r:1.35.18)
benoth = (t:see) <Sukkoth-benoth>
Benzoheth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ben-Zoheth) (d:a descendant of Judah, son of Ishi) (r:13.4.20)
Beon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Beon) (d:a town east of the Jordan in the land asked for by Reuben and Gad) (q:draft)
