Beora = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Bezer) (d:father of Balaam, the Beor of the Old Testament) (r:61.2.15)
bepi = (i:1) (t:n) (c:plant) (w:bean) (d:a kind of bean, named with lentils among foodstuffs) (s:belawi) (q:draft)
