bet = (i:1) (t:v) (w:slap/strike) (d:hit with the open hand, as on the cheek) (s:beeng/beng) (q:draft)
bet = (i:2) (t:v) (w:hunt) (d:hunt or chase animals; with <sa>, game animal, {sa bet} is to hunt game, in Hosea 9.13 said of people hunted down like game) (s:beng/gamvak) (q:draft, low confidence)
