bilteep = (i:1) (t:n) (w:earlobe/lobe of the ear) (d:the soft lower part of the ear, from <bil>, ear, and <teep>, tip) (r:3.14.25) (q:draft)
bilteepte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:earlobes/lobes of the ears) (d:plural of <bilteep>, earlobe) (b:bilteep) (q:draft)
bilun = (i:1) (t:n) (w:with ears/ears) (d:<bil>, ear, with <un>, the marker <in> joined to the plural <uh>; {ka bilun} is with our own ears) (b:bil) (r:10.7.22) (q:draft)
bilvang = (i:1) (t:n) (w:loop/eyelet/eye of a needle) (d:a small hole or loop, from <bil>, ear, and <vang>, hole: the loops on the edge of a curtain that take a clasp, and in {phim bilvang} the eye of a needle) (r:2.26.5/42.18.25/40.19.24) (q:draft)
bilvangte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:loops) (d:<bilvang>, loop or eyelet on the edge of a curtain, with plural <te>) (b:bilvang) (q:draft)
