bit = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:safe/secure) (d:safe from danger or loss, well guarded; {a bit tak-in} means securely) (s:muanhuai) (q:draft)
bit = (i:2) (t:adj) (w:full/complete/whole) (d:complete to the end, mostly of a period of time, as {kum khat bit}, a full year, and {kha khat bit}, a full month; {a bit-in} means in full) (q:draft)
