cimsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:fallen/broken down/collapsed) (d:<cim> fall down or collapse, with <sa> already done) (s:kicimsa) (b:cim) (q:draft)
cimsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:bring down/make collapse/shake) (d:<cim> fall down, with the causative <sak>: cause walls to fall; the NIV has tremble) (s:cimkhiasak) (b:cim) (q:draft)
cimsuk = (i:1) (t:v) (w:collapse/fall down/come crashing down) (d:<cim>, collapse, with <suk>, downward; of a wall or building, also bring a building down on people) (s:cim/puksuk) (b:cim) (q:draft)
