cimtak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be weary of/be tired of/loathe) (d:Be fed up with something or someone, be tired of doing something.) (s:cim/cimtaak) (a:lawp/uuk) (b:cim) (q:draft)
cimtakhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:wearisome/tiresome/troublesome) (d:<cimtak>, be weary of, with <huai>, worthy of: such as to make one weary) (q:draft)
cimtakin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be weary of/be tired of/be fed up with) (d:<cimtak> be fed up with someone, with the linking ending <in>) (b:cimtak) (q:draft)
cimtakta = (i:1) (t:v) (w:have grown weary of/be disgusted with) (d:<cimtak>, be weary of, with <ta> marking a change that has now come about) (b:cimtak) (q:draft)
