cin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be completed/be fulfilled/come to an end) (d:Of a period of time, be full or reach its end; written {cin’} before another word, as in {kum sagih a cin’ ciangin}, at the end of seven years.) (q:draft)
cin = (i:2) (t:v) (w:plant/sow) (s:suan/ciin) (q:draft, low confidence)
