cinna = (i:2) (t:n) (w:tending/growing/keeping) (d:the place where plants or water are kept and tended: {anteh cinna huan} is a vegetable garden, {singno cinna lo} is a plot for young trees, {tui lipi cinna phung} is a dam that holds a pond) (b:cin) (q:draft, low confidence)
