cip = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:tightly/firmly/fast/completely) (d:placed after a verb to show that the action is done tightly or so that it stays: {sin cip} seal up, {seel cip} hide away, {ding cip} stand still) (s:cinten) (q:draft, low confidence)
