Eliam = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eliam) (d:father of Bathsheba; also a son of Ahithophel among the mighty warriors of David) (r:10.11.3/10.23.34)
Eliasaf = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eliasaph) (d:name of two men, the son of Deuel who led the tribe of Gad in the wilderness and a leader of the Gershonites) (r:4.1.14/4.3.24)
Eliashib = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eliashib) (d:name of several men, among them the high priest in the time of Nehemiah) (r:13.3.24/15.10.36)
