ensim = (i:1) (t:v) (w:spy out/watch secretly/keep watch on) (d:look at a place or person closely without being noticed) (s:kansim/vilsim) (q:draft)
ensimin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:spying out/watching secretly) (d:<ensim>, spy out, with the linking suffix <in>: spying out and then doing the next action) (b:ensim) (q:draft)
ensuk = (i:1) (t:v) (w:look down) (d:<en>, look, with <suk>, downward: look down from a high place, often of God looking down from heaven) (s:khuadaksuk) (a:ento) (b:en) (q:draft)
ensukin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:looking down/look down) (d:form of <ensuk> with the linking suffix <in>, looking down and then going on to the next action) (b:ensuk) (q:draft)
