ente = (i:1) (t:n) (w:those who look/onlookers/watchers) (d:<en>, look, with the plural <te>: those who look at something; {gam ente} are the spies who look over a land) (b:en) (q:draft)
enteh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:compare/liken) (d:<en>, look, with <teh>, measure: set one thing beside another to compare them; used with <tawh>, with) (s:genteh/tehkak/tehpih/enkak) (q:draft)
entel = (i:1) (t:v) (w:examine/search/test/look into) (d:look at closely and thoroughly, from <en>, look, with <tel>, clearly; often said of God searching the heart and mind) (s:kantel/sin/sit/vel) (q:draft)
entelin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:examining/testing/searching) (d:<entel>, examine, with the linking suffix <in>: examining and then going on to the next action) (s:velin) (b:entel) (q:draft)
entheih = (i:1) (t:v) (w:come to envy/be moved to envy) (d:<en>, a form of <eng>, envy, with <theih>, be able: come to envy; {hong entheih nading} is so that they may envy) (q:draft, low confidence)
ento = (i:1) (t:v) (w:look up/look upward/look up to) (d:<en>, look, with <to>, upward: raise the eyes, often {vantung lam ento}, look up to heaven; also look to someone for help) (s:dakto/khuadakto) (a:ensuk/khuadaksuk) (b:en) (r:41.7.34) (q:draft)
enzo = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be able to look after/be able to care for) (d:<en>, look, here look after, with <zo>, be able; with <kei> it means not able to care for someone alone) (b:en) (q:draft)
