etlawmna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:beauty/splendour/loveliness) (d:<etlawm>, beautiful, with the noun suffix <na>: the quality of being lovely to look at) (s:melhoihna/meelhoihna) (b:etlawm) (q:draft)
etlawmsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:make beautiful/adorn/grace) (d:<etlawm>, lovely to look at, with the causative <sak>) (s:zep/zeem) (b:etlawm) (q:draft)
etna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:looking/watching/oversight) (d:<et>, look, with the noun suffix <na>: the act of looking at or looking out for something; {etna sunga om} is under the care of someone) (b:et) (q:draft)
etnate = (t:see) <ze-etnate>
etnopin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:desire to look at/look at with desire) (d:<et>, form of <en>, look, with <nop>, want to, and the linking suffix <in>; {etnopin nei} is keep wanting to look at) (q:draft, low confidence)
etphat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:check/inspect/look over) (d:look over a group carefully to see who is there; <et>, the form of <en>, look, used before a suffix, with <phat>) (s:vel) (q:draft)
etsa = (t:see) <kize-etsa>
etsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:look at/look upon/pay attention to) (d:<et>, look, with <sak>: turn the eyes to someone or something, often as a favour to the one who asks) (b:et) (q:draft, low confidence)
etsat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:loathe/detest/despise) (d:look on with disgust, turn away from; paired with <muhdah>, hate, and {etsat muhdahna} is malice) (s:mudah/hua/kih) (a:it) (q:draft)
etsathuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:detestable/disgusting/loathsome) (d:<etsat>, look on with disgust, with <huai>, deserving of: fit to be loathed) (s:kihhuai/muhdahhuai/mudahhuai) (a:ithuai) (q:draft)
etsuk = (i:1) (t:v) (w:look down/look down into) (d:<et>, form of <en>, look, with <suk>, downward: look down at or down into something) (s:khuadaksuk) (a:ettoh/dakto/khuadakto) (b:et) (q:draft)
etteh = (i:1) (t:n) (w:example/model/pattern) (d:someone or something that others look at to copy or to take warning from; <et>, look, with <teh>, measure; {etteh dingin} is as an example for) (s:limpha/gentehna/limlahna) (q:draft)
ettehin = (t:see) <ki-ettehin>
ettel = (i:1) (t:v) (w:examine/look at closely/observe) (d:form of <entel>, look at closely, used before <ciangin> and in dependent clauses; {ki-ettel} is examine oneself) (s:kantel/sin/sit/vel) (r:47.13.6) (q:draft)
ettelna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:examination/examining/testing) (d:<ettel>, examine, with the noun suffix <na>: a close looking into something; {lungsim tawng a ettelna} is the weighing of the inmost heart) (s:sittelna/kanna) (b:ettel) (r:47.13.5) (q:draft)
ettoh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:look up) (d:form of <ento>, look up, used before <leh> and <ciangin>) (s:dakto/khuadakto) (a:etsuk/khuadaksuk) (b:et) (q:draft)
