gamtang = (i:4) (t:phrase) (w:in motion)
gamtangsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cause to walk/cause to live) (d:<gamtang>, move about, with the causative <sak>: make people move about and live on the land) (b:gamtang) (q:draft, low confidence)
gamtangsakkik = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cause to walk again/cause to live again) (d:<gamtangsak> with <kik>, again) (b:gamtangsak) (q:draft, low confidence)
gamtangtang = (i:1) (t:v) (w:move along/go by) (d:doubled form of <gamtang>, move: keep moving on) (q:draft, low confidence)
gamtangzo = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be able to move about/be able to go about) (d:<gamtang>, move about, with <zo>, be able) (b:gamtang) (q:draft)
