gamtat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:behave) (d:form of <gamta> used before words such as <ding>, <bangin>, <leh>, <kei>, <khin> and <nading>) (b:gamta)
gamtat = (i:2) (t:v) (w:act/do) (b:gamta) (r:20.11.19)
gamtate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:those who act/those who behave) (d:plural: people who conduct themselves in the way stated before the word) (s:gamtatte) (b:gamta) (q:draft)
gamtateng = (i:1) (t:v) (w:all who do/all who act) (d:<gamta>, act, with <teng>, all: all those who act so) (b:gamta) (q:draft)
gamtatin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:acting/behaving) (d:<gamtat> with the linking ending {-in}: acting in the way named before it, as in {hai gamtatin}, acting foolishly) (b:gamtat) (q:draft)
gamtatkha = (i:1) (t:v) (w:act/behave) (d:<gamtat>, act, with <kha>, which marks something one comes to do without meaning to; in the verses of having acted wrongly or foolishly) (q:draft)
gamtatkhak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:act/behave) (d:form of <gamtatkha>, come to act in a way not intended, used before <ding>; {a sia-in gamtatkhak} is fall into doing evil) (b:gamtatkha) (q:draft, low confidence)
gamtatkik = (i:1) (t:v) (w:act rightly again/return to right conduct) (d:<gamtat>, behave, with <kik>, again or back) (b:gamtat) (q:draft)
gamtatna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:action/deed/conduct/works) (d:<gamtat>, act, with the noun suffix <na>: what a person does, his deeds and way of acting) (s:hihna/tatna) (b:gamtat) (r:1.9.24)
gamtatna = (i:2) (t:n) (w:activity/movement) (b:gamtat)
