gamtatpha = (i:1) (t:n) (w:good deed/good conduct/good) (d:<gamtat> behave with <pha> good: doing what is good) (s:hoihtatna) (a:gamtatsia/gamtatsiatna) (q:draft)
gamtatsa = (i:1) (t:v) (w:have done/did) (d:<gamtat>, act, with <sa>, already done; {gamtatsa bangin} is as someone had done) (b:gamtat) (q:draft)
