gamtatsiate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:evildoers/the wicked) (d:<gamtatsia>, of bad conduct, with the plural <te>: people who do evil) (s:migilote/misiate/tatsiate) (a:midikte/mihoihte) (b:gamtatsia) (q:draft)
gamtatsiate = (i:2) (t:n) (w:evil deeds/wrongdoings) (d:<gamtatsia>, bad conduct, with the plural <te>: the wrong things that someone has done) (s:gamtatsiatnate/tatsiatnate/siatnate) (a:hoihnate) (b:gamtatsia) (q:draft, low confidence)
