gamtatsiatnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:evil deeds/wrongdoings) (d:plural of <gamtatsiatna>: the evil things that people have done) (s:gamtatsiate/tatsiatnate/siatnate) (a:hoihnate) (b:gamtatsiatna) (q:draft)
gamtatte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:practices/deeds/doings) (d:<gamtat> used as a noun with plural {-te}: the things someone does, ways of behaving) (s:gamtatnate/tatnate/gamtatziate) (b:gamtat) (q:draft)
