gamtatzawh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be able to act/be able to do) (d:<gamtat>, act, with <zawh>, be able; {cit gamtatzawh} is be able to act generously) (s:hihzawh) (q:draft, low confidence)
gamtatzia = (i:1) (t:n) (w:conduct/way of acting/example/practice) (d:the manner in which someone acts, and so an example for others; {gamtatzia zui} means follow the example of) (s:tatna/nuntakzia) (q:draft)
gamtatziate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:actions/ways of acting/doings) (d:plural of <gamtatzia>: the ways in which someone acts) (s:gamtatnate/tatnate/gamtatnaziate) (b:gamtatzia) (q:draft)
gamtazaw = (i:1) (t:v) (w:act rather/act instead/behave rather) (d:<gamta>, act, with <zaw>, rather: do this and not the other thing) (b:gamta) (q:draft)
