gamte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:lands/countries/territories/kingdoms) (d:plural of <gam>; {kumpi gamte} are kingdoms, and {a lonona gamte} the pasturelands of a town) (s:leitangte) (b:gam) (r:19.79.6) (q:draft)
