gankhawk = (i:1) (t:n) (w:fold/pen/enclosure) (d:<gan> livestock with <khawk>, a marked-off section: place where a flock is gathered, named beside {tuubuk} sheep pen; the NIV has pasture) (q:draft, low confidence)
