Gibbethom = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Gibbethon) (d:spelling of Gibbethon in 1 Kings 15:27, the Philistine town that Nadab was besieging when he was killed) (r:11.15.27)
Gibbethon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Gibbethon) (d:town in the territory of Dan given to the Levites, later held by the Philistines and besieged by Israel) (r:6.21.23/6.19.44)
Gibea = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Gibea) (d:town in Judah whose founder was Sheva, a descendant of Caleb) (q:draft)
Gibeah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Gibeah) (d:name of several towns, chiefly Gibeah in Benjamin, the home of King Saul, and a town in the hill country of Judah) (r:6.15.57/9.15.34)
Gibeath = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Gibeath) (d:first part of the place names Gibeath Haaraloth and Gibeath Elohim; the Hebrew word means hill of) (r:6.5.3)
