guak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:uncover)
guak = (i:4) (t:adv) (w:just) (d:merely, no more than: {kei guak hi lo} is not just I)
guak = (i:5) (t:adv) (w:solo/single-handed) (d:doing something by oneself, without the help of others)
