guak = (i:7) (t:adj) (w:bare/empty) (d:with nothing on it or in it: {khe guak} is barefoot, {khut guak} is with bare or empty hands, {guh guak} is bare bones)
guakbek = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:alone/lonely/by oneself) (d:<guak> alone with <bek> only: all alone) (s:khatguak) (q:draft)
