gunvapite = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (w:storks/large water birds) (d:<gun> river with <vapi> big bird and plural <te>, named with {gunva} as birds that roost in a ruined city; the English versions have owl, bittern or pelican here, so the kind of bird is not certain) (q:draft, low confidence)
gup = (i:1) (t:v) (w:save/rescue) (d:form of <gum>, save, used before <thei>, <nop>, <zawh>, <tuak>, <ding> and <nading>) (s:hon/honkhia/hotkhiat) (a:siatsak) (q:draft)
