gupha = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:venomous/deadly/poisonous) (d:having strong venom or a deadly bite, of a snake, a scorpion or fangs; from <gu> poison) (s:gunei) (r:5.32.33) (q:draft)
guphate = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:venomous/poisonous) (d:<gupha>, venomous, with the plural <te>; {gul guphate}, venomous snakes) (s:guneite) (b:gupha) (q:draft)
