gupna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:salvation) (d:<gup>, save, with the noun suffix <na>: salvation; <gupna ngah> is receive salvation, be saved, and {gupna thu} is the message of salvation) (s:hotkhiatna/gupkhiatna/hotna) (r:49.6.17) (q:draft)
Gupna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:salvation) (d:<gupna> written with a capital; {Gupna a ngah}, receive salvation, be saved) (s:hotkhiatna/gupkhiatna) (b:gupna) (r:66.7.10) (q:draft)
guptuam = (i:1) (t:n) (w:partiality/favouritism) (d:<gup>, save, with <tuam>, separately: favouring one person over another; in the pair <guptuam paihtuam>, favouring one and rejecting another) (s:khentuam/angvanna/deidanna) (q:draft)
Gur = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Gur) (d:place near Ibleam where King Ahaziah of Judah was wounded as he fled from Jehu; {Gur kahtohna} is the way up to Gur) (q:draft)
