hatnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:strength/might/powers) (d:<hatna>, strength, with the plural <te>) (s:thahatnate/vangliatnate) (b:hatna) (q:draft)
hatpa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:strong man/strong one/mighty one) (d:<hat>, strong, with <pa>, marking a man; {ka gal hatpa} is my powerful enemy) (s:thahatpa) (b:hat) (q:draft)
hatpen = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:strongest/mightiest) (d:<hat>, strong, with <pen>, most; after another verb it means most of all, as in {khem hatpen}, most deceitful) (s:thahatpen) (b:hat) (q:draft)
hatpente = (i:1) (t:n) (w:the strongest/the sturdiest) (d:<hatpen>, strongest, with the plural <te>) (s:thahatpente) (b:hatpen) (q:draft)
