hauhnopna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:desire for riches/love of wealth) (d:<hauhnop>, want to be rich, with the noun suffix <na>) (b:hauhnop) (q:draft)
hauhpakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:getting rich quickly/quick wealth) (d:<hauh>, be rich, with <pak>, quickly, and the noun suffix <na>: wealth gained in a hurry) (q:draft)
hauhpen = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:richest) (d:<hauh>, be rich, with <pen>, most) (s:haupen) (b:hauh) (q:draft)
