haupa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:rich man) (d:<hau>, rich, with <pa>, marking a man; also {mi haupa} and {sum haupa}) (s:mihaupa) (a:zawngpa/mizawngpa) (b:hau) (q:draft)
haupen = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:richest/wealthiest) (d:<hau>, rich, with <pen>, most) (s:hauhpen) (a:zawngpen) (b:hau) (q:draft)
