hauzaw = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:richer/wealthier/have more) (d:<hau>, rich, with <zaw>, more: richer, or have more of something; after <sangin> it means richer than) (b:hau) (q:draft)
Havilah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Havilah) (d:land rich in gold around which the river Pishon flows; also the name of a son of Cush and of a son of Joktan) (r:1.2.11/1.25.18)
Havvoth = (t:see) <Havvoth-jair>
