huihnung = (i:1) (t:n) (w:wind/breeze) (d:<huih>, wind, with <nung>, blow: the wind that is blowing; {huihnung dai} means the wind dies down) (s:huih) (q:draft)
huihpi = (i:1) (t:n) (w:storm/strong wind/tempest/whirlwind) (d:<huih> wind with <pi> great: a strong wind or storm; {huihpi lak} is the midst of the storm) (s:pingpei/khuapihuih) (b:huih) (q:draft)
