huihsa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:scorching wind/hot wind) (d:<huih>, wind, with <sa>, hot: the burning wind of the desert) (a:huihvot) (b:huih) (q:draft)
huihte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:winds) (d:plural of <huih>, wind) (b:huih) (q:draft)
