Ja-areshiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaareshiah) (d:son of Jeroham in the tribe of Benjamin) (r:13.8.27) (q:draft)
Ja-asiel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaasiel) (d:son of Abner, officer over the tribe of Benjamin in the time of David) (q:draft)
