Ja-aziah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaaziah) (d:Levite, descendant of Merari and father of Beno) (r:13.24.27) (q:draft)
Ja-aziel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaaziel) (d:Levite of the second rank who served when David brought the ark to Jerusalem) (r:13.15.18) (q:draft)
