Jaakan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Akan/Jaakan) (d:son of Ezer, a descendant of Seir the Horite; called Akan in the NIV) (r:13.1.42) (q:draft)
Jaakobah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaakobah) (d:clan leader in the tribe of Simeon) (r:13.4.36)
Jaala = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaala) (d:ancestor of a family of the servants of Solomon who returned from the exile) (q:draft)
