Jaareshiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaareshiah) (d:son of Jeroham in the tribe of Benjamin) (r:13.8.27)
Jaasiel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaasiel) (d:name of two men: one of the mighty warriors of David, and the son of Abner who was officer over Benjamin) (r:13.11.47)
Jaasu = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaasu) (d:descendant of Bani who had married a foreign wife in the time of Ezra) (r:15.10.37)
Jaazaniah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaazaniah) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Shaphan seen by Ezekiel in the temple and a Rekabite in the time of Jeremiah) (r:26.8.11/24.35.3)
Jaaziah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaaziah) (d:Levite, descendant of Merari and father of Beno) (r:13.24.27/13.24.26)
