Jabbok = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land/river) (w:Jabbok) (d:river east of the Jordan and flowing into it, where Jacob crossed the ford; a border of the land of the Ammonites) (r:7.11.22/1.32.22)
Jabesh = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Jabesh) (d:town in Gilead east of the Jordan, also called Jabesh Gilead, where the bones of Saul were buried) (r:9.11.9) (q:draft)
Jabesh = (i:2) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jabesh) (d:father of Shallum king of Israel) (q:draft)
Jabeshgilead = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place/city) (w:Jabesh Gilead) (d:town in Gilead east of the Jordan, rescued by Saul, whose people later buried him) (r:9.31.11/9.11.1)
Jabez = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male/place) (w:Jabez) (d:man of Judah more honorable than his brothers, whose prayer God granted; also a town where clans of scribes lived) (r:13.4.9/13.2.55)
Jabin = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jabin) (d:name of two kings of Hazor in Canaan, one defeated by Joshua and one in the time of Deborah and Barak) (r:6.11.1/7.4.23)
Jabne = (t:see) <Jabne-el>
Jabne-el = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Jabneel) (d:name of a town on the border of Judah and of one on the border of Naphtali) (r:6.15.11) (q:draft)
Jabneel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Jabneel) (d:name of a town on the border of Judah and of one on the border of Naphtali) (r:6.15.11/6.19.33)
Jabneh = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Jabneh) (d:Philistine city whose wall King Uzziah of Judah broke down) (r:14.26.6)
Jada = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jada) (d:son of Onam and brother of Shammai, a descendant of Jerahmeel in Judah) (r:13.2.28/13.2.32)
