Jakobte = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jacob) (d:<Jakob> with the plural <te>, closing the list of the fathers: Abraham, Isaac and Jacob) (b:Jakob) (r:2.6.3/40.8.11)
Jalam = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jalam) (d:son of Esau and Oholibamah, a chief of Edom) (r:1.36.5/13.1.35)
Jalon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jalon) (d:son of Ezrah, a descendant of Judah) (q:draft)
