James = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:James) (d:name of several men, among them the apostle James, brother of John, and the apostle James son of Alphaeus) (r:44.12.2/42.6.15)
Jamin = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jamin) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Simeon and a son of Ram in Judah) (r:4.26.12) (q:draft)
