Janai = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Janai) (d:chief of the tribe of Gad who lived in Bashan) (r:13.5.12)
Janim = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Janim) (d:town in the hill country of Judah) (r:6.15.53)
