Jannes = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jannes) (d:one of the two men who opposed Moses, named together with Jambres) (r:55.3.8)
Janoah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Janoah) (d:town on the eastern border of Ephraim; also a town in northern Israel taken by Tiglath-Pileser) (r:6.16.7/6.16.6)
Jaob = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Joab) (d:Joab, commander of David's army, as spelled in 1 Kings 1:41) (r:11.1.41)
Jarah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jadah/Jarah) (d:son of Ahaz, a descendant of King Saul through Jonathan) (r:13.9.42)
Jared = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jared) (d:son of Mahalalel and father of Enoch, in the line from Adam to Noah) (r:1.5.15)
Jarha = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jarha) (d:Egyptian servant of Sheshan, who married Sheshan's daughter) (r:13.2.35/13.2.34)
Jarib = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jarib) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Simeon and a priest who had married a foreign woman) (r:13.4.24/15.10.18)
Jarmuth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Jarmuth) (d:Canaanite royal town in the lowland of Judah; also a Levite town in Issachar) (r:6.15.35/6.10.3)
Jaroah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jaroah) (d:man of the tribe of Gad, son of Gilead) (r:13.5.14)
Jashar = (i:1) (t:name) (w:Jashar) (d:the Book of Jashar, an old book quoted in Joshua and 2 Samuel) (r:10.1.18/6.10.13)
Jashen = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Jashen) (d:father of some of David's mighty warriors) (r:10.23.32)
