Karkor = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Karkor) (d:place east of the Jordan where Gideon surprised the army of the Midianite kings Zebah and Zalmunna) (r:7.8.10)
Karmel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Carmel) (d:town in the hill country of Judah, the home of Nabal; also the name of Mount Carmel near the coast of Israel) (r:6.15.55)
