Karnaim = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Karnaim) (d:town east of the Jordan that Israel boasted of taking; also part of the name Ashteroth Karnaim) (r:30.6.13)
karnelian = (i:1) (t:n) (c:stone) (w:carnelian) (d:a precious stone, the sixth foundation stone of the new Jerusalem; the NIV has ruby) (s:sardius/sardis) (q:draft)
Karnelian = (i:1) (t:name) (c:stone) (w:carnelian) (d:red precious stone, written with a capital in lists of stones; the NIV has ruby in Revelation 4:3) (r:26.28.13/66.4.3)
Karpas = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Carpus) (d:man at Troas with whom Paul left his cloak) (r:55.4.13)
Karsar = (i:1) (t:name) (w:Caesar) (d:title of the Roman emperor, to whom Paul appealed) (r:44.25.21)
