katna = (i:2) (t:n) (w:fork/branching/parting) (d:<kat>, be split, with {-na}: the place where a road divides in two) (b:kat) (q:draft, low confidence)
katsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:scorch/cause to burn) (d:<kat> burn, with <sak>, cause: make fire burn someone) (b:kat) (q:draft)
