kattumsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:burned/burned up) (d:<kattum> burn up, with <sa>, already done) (s:kangtumsa) (b:kattum) (q:draft)
kattumsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:burn up/scorch) (d:<kattum>, burn up, with <sak>: of fire, burn up something that belongs to someone, as the branches of a tree) (s:kangtumsak) (b:kattum) (q:draft)
