kauhkauh = (i:1) (t:adv) (d:expressive adverb for an action that goes on hard and without stopping, as hands shaking with fear or tears running down the cheeks) (q:draft, low confidence)
kauphe = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (w:locust/grasshopper) (d:locust or grasshopper, an insect that comes in swarms and eats the crops; {kauphe honpi} is a swarm of locusts) (q:draft)
