kawi = (i:1) (t:v) (w:embrace/hug) (d:put the arms around someone; {ngawng kawi} is throw the arms around the neck of someone) (s:pom) (r:20.7.13) (q:draft)
kawi = (i:2) (t:adj) (w:crooked/devious/perverse) (d:not straight, bent; of the heart or mind, devious and perverse, as in {lungsim kawi}) (s:thukawi) (a:mam) (q:draft)
kawi = (i:3) (t:v) (w:turn/curve/go around) (d:go in a bend or roundabout way rather than straight, of a boundary that turns or of someone walking about, as in {kawi pai}) (s:kihei) (q:draft)
