Kenaz = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Kenaz) (d:name of several men, among them a grandson of Esau who was a chief of Edom) (r:13.1.53) (q:draft)
Kenaz = (i:2) (t:name) (c:people) (w:Kenizzite/Kenizzites) (d:the Kenizzites, one of the peoples whose land was promised to Abraham; written {Kenaz mite}) (q:draft)
kengin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:carrying/taking along/bringing) (d:<keng>, have a thing with one, with the linking ending {-in} before a verb of going or coming) (b:keng) (q:draft)
