kengthuah = (i:1) (t:v) (w:take extra/take in addition) (d:<keng> take along, with <thuah>, in addition: carry a spare) (q:draft)
kenkan = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:quietly/patiently) (d:expressive word after <ngak> wait: wait on steadily and quietly) (q:draft, low confidence)
