kepsak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:keep for/look after for) (d:keep or tend something on behalf of another) (b:kep) (q:draft)
kepsakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:thing entrusted/deposit) (d:<kepsak> entrust, with the noun suffix <na>; {na kepsakna} is the entrusting of a thing to someone for keeping) (b:kepsak) (q:draft)
