Keziah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:female) (w:Keziah) (d:the second daughter born to Job after his trials) (r:18.42.14)
kha = (i:1) (t:n) (w:spirit/soul) (d:the spirit or soul of a person, and the Spirit of God; {kha an} is spiritual food) (r:1.1.2)
kha = (i:2) (t:n) (w:moon) (d:the moon, often named together with <ni>, the sun, and <aksi>, the stars) (s:khapi)
kha = (i:4) (t:part) (d:particle suffixed to verbs to convey the meaning of "happened") (r:18.21.25)
khaam = (i:1) (t:v) (w:forbid/prohibit/stop/restrain) (d:tell someone not to do a thing, or hold a person or thing back; {khaam zo} is be able to stop) (a:phal) (q:draft)
