khahkhiatna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:deliverance/rescue/release) (d:<khahkhiat>, set free, with the noun suffix <na>: the act of setting free or rescuing; also the sending out of something) (s:hotkhiatna/suahtakna/suahtaksakna) (b:khahkhiat) (q:draft)
khahkhiatsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:set free/released/freed) (d:<khahkhiat>, set free, with <sa>, already done: that has been set free) (b:khahkhiat) (q:draft)
