Khuampi = (i:1) (t:n) (w:pillar) (d:<khuampi> written with a capital at the start of a sentence or in {Khuampi Innpi}, the Hall of Pillars built by Solomon, colonnade in the NIV) (b:khuampi) (q:draft)
