kikhawhsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be farmed for/be cultivated for) (d:of land, be worked for someone; {a kikhawhsak mite}, those for whom it is farmed) (q:draft, low confidence)
kikhawi = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be kept/be reared/be bred) (d:<khawi>, keep and look after an animal, with the prefix <ki>: of horses kept in the royal stable) (b:khawi) (q:draft)
kikhawl = (i:1) (t:v) (w:accompany/keep company with/associate with) (d:be in the company of someone and go about with them; the companion is marked by <tawh>, with) (s:kikholh/kipawl) (b:khawl)
kikhawl = (i:2) (t:n) (w:companion) (d:one who keeps company with another; {a kikhawl mi} is a companion of the person or group named with <tawh>) (s:kikhawlpa/kikholhpih/lawm) (b:khawl)
kikhawla = (i:1) (t:v) (w:keeping company/associating) (d:<kikhawl>, accompany, with the linking <a>: going about with someone and then doing something) (b:kikhawl) (q:draft)
kikhawlin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:keeping company/being together/associating) (d:<kikhawl> with the linking ending <in>: being together with, <tawh> marks the companion) (s:kipawlin) (b:kikhawl) (q:draft)
kikhawlpa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:friend/companion) (d:<kikhawl>, keep company, with <pa> marking a man: a man who keeps company with someone, used with <tawh>) (s:lawmpa/kikholhpihpa) (b:kikhawl) (r:40.11.19) (q:draft)
kikhawlpih = (i:1) (t:n) (w:companion/friend) (d:<kikhawl>, keep company, with <pih>, together with: a person one keeps company with) (s:kikhawlpa/kikholhpih/lawm)
kikhawlsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be stopped/be detained/be made to cease) (d:<khawlsak>, make stop, with the passive prefix <ki>: be stopped, or be kept back in a place) (s:kitawpsak/kikhaktan) (b:khawlsak) (q:draft)
kikhawlsak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:make keep company with/seat with/let associate with) (d:<kikhawl>, keep company, with the causative <sak>: let or make someone be in the company of the people named with <tawh>) (b:kikhawl) (q:draft)
kikhawlte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:companions/partners/associates) (d:<kikhawl>, keep company, with the plural <te>: those who keep company with the person or group named with <tawh>) (s:kikholhpihte/lawmte) (b:kikhawl) (q:draft)
