kikhawmtuah = (i:1) (t:v) (w:gather together/assemble/unite) (d:come together in one place or as one group, also to join against someone) (s:kisutuah) (a:kikhenthang) (q:draft)
kikhawng = (i:1) (t:v) (w:fetch/be sold for) (d:<khawng>, ask a price, with the prefix <ki>: of goods, bring a certain price when sold) (b:khawng) (q:draft)
