kikheelsakin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:turning/making change) (d:<kikheelsak> with the linking suffix <in>: making someone turn from wrong ways) (b:kikheelsak) (q:draft)
kikheem = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be deceived/deceive oneself) (d:<kheem>, deceive, with the prefix <ki>: be deceived, or deceive oneself) (s:kikhemtawm) (b:kheem) (q:draft)
kikheemin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:deceiving oneself) (d:<kikheem>, deceive oneself, with the linking suffix <in>) (b:kikheem) (q:draft)
