Kikheemna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:deception) (d:<kikheemna> written with a capital at the start of a sentence) (s:kheemna/khemna) (b:kikheemna) (q:draft)
kikheen = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be driven in/be fastened) (d:of a peg, be driven into a firm place) (q:draft, low confidence)
