kikhuatin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:scrape oneself/scratch oneself) (d:<khuat>, scratch or scrape, with the reflexive prefix <ki> and the linking ending <in>) (q:draft)
kikhuh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cover oneself/be covered/veil oneself) (d:<khuh>, cover, with the reflexive <ki>: cover oneself, as with a veil; {a tung kikhuh nading} is a covering over oneself) (b:khuh) (q:draft)
