kikhupsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:close/let close) (d:of the eyelids, let them shut in sleep) (q:draft)
kikiasak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be thrown down/be made to fall) (d:passive of <kiasak>, cause to fall; here of people cast into pits) (b:kiasak) (q:draft)
