kikiasuksak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:throw oneself down) (d:<kikiasuk> with the causative <sak>: make oneself fall down) (b:kikiasuk) (q:draft)
kikiat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shave oneself/be shaved) (d:<kiat>, shave, with the prefix <ki>; {amah le amah a mul kikiat}, shave off one's own hair) (b:kiat) (q:draft)
kikiatin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be scoured/be scraped) (d:<kikiat> with the linking ending <in>; of a metal pot scraped clean before it is rinsed) (b:kikiat) (q:draft)
