laigelhte = (i:2) (t:n) (w:letters/writings/dispatches) (d:<laigelh> with the plural <te>: things that someone has written, such as letters, dispatches and the writings of the prophets) (s:laikhakte/laite/laigelhnate) (b:laigelh) (q:draft)
