laikhak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:send a letter/write to) (d:<lai>, letter, with <khak>, send: send a letter to someone; more often written as two words, {lai khak}) (q:draft, low confidence)
laikhakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:letter/writing) (d:<laikhak>, send a letter, with the noun suffix <na>: the letter sent or the sending of it) (s:laikhak/laigelhna) (b:laikhak) (q:draft)
