laikhia = (i:1) (t:v) (w:tear down/demolish/pull down) (d:pull a building apart and clear it away; built with <khia>, out) (s:phelkhia/susia) (q:draft, low confidence)
laikung = (i:1) (t:n) (w:pen/stylus/marker) (d:a tool for writing or for marking a line; {sik laikung} is an iron pen) (q:draft)
