lamente = (i:1) (t:n) (w:those who wait for/those who look forward to) (d:<lamen> expect with the plural <te>) (b:lamen) (q:draft)
lamet = (i:1) (t:v) (w:hope/hope for/expect/look for) (d:form of <lamen> used before endings such as <leh>, <loh> and <ding>; also a noun stem, hope, as in {lamet tun’lohna}, hope not fulfilled) (r:18.30.26) (q:draft)
lametet = (i:1) (t:v) (w:hope for/expect eagerly/long for) (d:<lamet>, hope, with its last syllable repeated: keep hoping for over a long time) (q:draft)
lamethuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:hopeful/worth hoping for) (d:<lamet>, hope, with <huai>, worthy of; {a lamethuai bangmah om lo} is there is nothing to hope for) (s:lam-ethuai) (q:draft)
lametin = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:as one's hope) (d:<lamet>, hope, with <in>; {lametin nei} is to have as one's hope, put one's hope in) (b:lamet) (q:draft)
lametna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:hope/expectation) (d:<lamet>, hope, with the noun suffix <na>: what a person looks forward to or trusts will come) (r:25.3.29) (q:draft)
lametnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:hopes/things hoped for) (d:plural of <lametna>) (s:lamette) (b:lametna) (q:draft)
