lamette = (i:1) (t:n) (w:things hoped for) (d:<lamet> with the plural <te>, the things one hopes for) (s:lametnate) (b:lamet) (q:draft)
lamgal = (i:1) (t:n) (w:side/bank) (d:the land on one side of a river; {hih lamgal} is this side) (q:draft, low confidence)
lamgei = (t:see) <lamgei-ah>
