lamhilh = (i:1) (t:n) (w:guide) (d:one who shows the way, <lam>, way, with <hilh>, teach) (q:draft)
lamhilhte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:guides) (d:<lamhilh>, guide, with the plural <te>; {mittaw lamhilhte} are blind guides) (s:lamlakte/makaihte) (b:lamhilh) (q:draft)
