lamin = (i:2) (t:ppm) (d:<lam>, side or way, with the suffix <in>, showing direction, manner or time; {a hoih lamin} is favourably, <nitak lamin> is in the evening) (b:lam) (q:draft)
lamka = (i:1) (t:n) (w:crossroads/fork in the road/road junction) (d:the place where roads part or meet) (s:kabom) (r:26.21.21) (q:draft)
lamkabom = (i:1) (t:n) (w:public square/square/open place) (d:an open place in a town where roads meet and people gather) (s:tualpi) (q:draft)
lamkabomah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:in the marketplace/in the public square) (d:<lamkabom>, public square, with the place marker <ah>) (b:lamkabom) (r:40.11.16) (q:draft)
lamkabomte = (t:see) <lamkabomte-ah>
lamkabomte-ah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:in the public squares/in the streets) (d:<lamkabom>, public square, with plural <te> and the place marker <ah>) (q:draft)
