lamkhial = (i:2) (t:v) (w:misroute)
lamkhial = (i:3) (t:v) (w:veer)
Lamkhial = (i:1) (t:v) (w:go astray/take the wrong road) (d:<lam> way with <khial> err; {Lamkhial mite} are people who have left the right way, NIV faithless people) (b:lamkhial) (q:draft)
lamkhialin = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:astray/going the wrong way) (d:<lamkhial> with the linking suffix <in>) (b:lamkhial) (q:draft)
