laute = (i:1) (t:n) (w:those who fear) (d:<lau> fear with the plural <te>: the ones who are afraid) (s:kihtate) (b:lau) (q:draft)
lauthawng = (i:1) (t:n) (w:fear/anxiety/apprehension/trepidation/nervousness/unease) (d:sudden fear or alarm; {lauthawng kawmin} is with fear) (s:launa/kihtakna)
lauthawng = (i:2) (t:v) (w:frighten/scare/panic/startle) (d:be struck with sudden fear or alarm, as in {lungsim lauthawng mite}, people whose hearts are fearful)
lauthawngna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:alarm) (d:<lauthawng> with the noun suffix <na>: sudden alarm or fright) (s:patauhna) (b:lauthawng) (r:19.31.22)
