lawhna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:picking/gathering/harvest) (d:the picking of fruit from a tree or vine) (q:draft)
lawhna = (i:2) (t:n) (w:reciting) (d:the saying aloud of words, here of the commandments) (b:lawh) (q:draft, low confidence)
