lawhsakkhak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:pass on to/affect by contact) (d:<lawhsak> cause to spread by contact, with <khak>, happen to: make people holy by bringing holy things among them) (q:draft, low confidence)
lawhta = (i:1) (t:n) (w:omer/measure) (d:a small dry measure for grain; it renders the omer of Exodus and the daily ration measure of Revelation) (r:2.16.36) (q:draft)
lawhtak = (i:1) (t:n) (w:gain/profit/portion) (d:what one really gets out of work or effort) (q:draft)
