lehtai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rebuke in return/rebuke) (d:<leh> back with <tai>, scold: answer a rebuke with a rebuke) (q:draft)
lehtai = (i:2) (t:v) (w:run back/come running back) (d:<leh> back with <tai> run) (s:taikik) (q:draft)
