liahin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:covering) (d:<liah> cover with the ending <in>) (b:liah) (q:draft)
liahkhak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:fall upon/overshadow) (d:<liah>, cover, shade, with <khak>, reach, happen to touch: of a shadow falling on someone) (q:draft)
