liahna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:shade/shelter/shadow/protection) (d:<liah>, cover, with the noun suffix <na>: a covering that shades or protects; {liahna puan} is a veil) (s:liim/bukna/hutna) (b:liah) (q:draft)
liahsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cause to cover/cover with) (d:<liah> cover with the causative <sak>: make a cloud hide the sun) (b:liah) (q:draft)
liahtumsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:consume/eat up/devour) (d:in the verse, of others using up all that a man owns; apparently <liah> lick with <tum>, all up, and <sak>) (q:draft, low confidence)
liai = (t:see) <liai-liai>
liai-liai = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:barely/only just) (d:placed after a verb: to a small degree, by a narrow margin; {nungta liai-liai} is barely alive) (s:liailiai) (q:draft, low confidence)
