liak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:lick/lap) (d:take up with the tongue, as a dog licks a sore or laps water) (q:draft)
liakin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:licking) (d:<liak> lick with the ending <in>) (b:liak) (q:draft)
