lohzawh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be able to pay/be able to repay) (d:<loh>, pay, with <zawh>, the form of <zo>, be able, used before {kei leh}: {a lohzawh kei leh} is if he cannot pay) (s:lohzo) (q:draft)
