luahnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:inheritances/territories) (d:<luahna> inheritance, with the plural <te>: the shares of land received) (s:gamhte) (b:luahna) (q:draft)
luahnate = (i:2) (t:n) (w:shovels) (d:in {vut luahnate}, the tools for taking up ashes from the altar) (s:vutluahnate/kawbiate) (q:draft, low confidence)
