luahsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cause to inherit/give as a possession/let occupy) (d:<luah> inherit, possess, with causative <sak>) (b:luah) (r:26.7.24) (q:draft)
luahte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:inheritance/heritage/possessions) (d:plural of <luah>; in the Psalms the {luahte} of God are the people who belong to him) (b:luah) (q:draft)
luai = (i:1) (t:n) (w:palanquin/litter/carriage) (d:a covered seat on which a person is carried) (q:draft, low confidence)
luai = (i:2) (t:v) (w:lean on/press against) (d:bear down on something with one's weight) (q:draft, low confidence)
luai = (i:3) (t:v) (w:hang heavy/be laden) (d:of a tree weighed down with fruit) (q:draft, low confidence)
