luakkhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:vomit out/spew out) (d:the form of <luakkhia> used before <bangin> and {loh nading}; <luak> vomit with <khia> out) (b:luakkhia) (q:draft)
luaksuahhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:nauseating/sickening/loathsome) (d:making one want to vomit, with <huai> for what causes a feeling) (q:draft)
lualiang = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:excessively/too much) (d:placed after a verb: do something to excess; in the verse of praising someone overmuch) (q:draft, low confidence)
