luang = (i:2) (t:v) (w:stream) (d:of tears, milk and honey or other liquid: run in a stream, pour down like a river)
luanghawm = (i:1) (t:n) (w:corpse/dead body/carcass) (d:the dead body of a person or the carcass of an animal) (s:siluang/misiluang) (q:draft)
