luangluangin = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:limping/haltingly) (d:describes the walk of a lame person in {bai luangluangin pai}) (q:draft, low confidence)
luangsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:cause to flow/make flow/shed) (d:<luang> flow with the causative <sak>; {sisan luangsak} is shed blood) (s:luangkhiasak) (b:luang) (q:draft)
luangsakgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shed in abundance/make flow freely) (d:<luangsak> cause to flow with <gawp>, which marks a thorough or violent action; of shedding the blood of enemies) (b:luangsak) (q:draft, low confidence)
