lungmuannate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:securities/things trusted in) (d:plural of <lungmuanna>; in the verse beside <hauhna> wealth, of what the wicked rely on) (b:lungmuanna) (q:draft, low confidence)
lungmuansak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:give security/make secure) (d:<lungmuan> be secure with the causative <sak>) (s:lungmuangsak/lungmuanhuaisak) (b:lungmuan) (q:draft)
lungneemna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:gentleness/meekness/patience) (d:<lung> heart with <neem> soft and the noun suffix <na>) (s:lungnemna) (a:lungkhauhna) (q:draft)
