lungnemsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:please/win the favor of) (d:<lungnem> soft-hearted with the causative <sak>: soften the heart of someone, win them over; {mite lungnemsak mi} is one who pleases people) (b:lungnem) (q:draft)
