lungnemzaw = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:more humble/meeker) (d:<lungnem> humble with the comparative <zaw>) (b:lungnem) (q:draft)
lungngai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:ponder/consider/think about) (d:think over in the heart; also have in mind or intend to do something) (s:ngaihsun) (r:44.15.37) (q:draft)
Lungngai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:remember/think about) (d:<lungngai> written with a capital at the start of a quoted line; with {nawn lo} it means remember no more) (b:lungngai) (q:draft)
