lungnuam = (i:1) (t:v) (w:delight/be glad/be at ease/be at peace) (d:<lung> heart with <nuam> pleasant: be glad and at ease; {lungnuam takin} means happily, in peace or safely) (s:lungdam) (a:lungkham)
