mat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:seize/catch/arrest/capture) (d:second form of <man>, catch, used before words such as <khit>, <nading>, <ding> and <bangin>: seize, arrest, catch fish or game; {mang mat} is to have a dream) (a:khahkhiat) (r:1.37.6) (q:draft)
