mate = (i:2) (t:n) (d:those who divorce, from <ma> divorce or send away a spouse, with the plural ending <te>) (q:draft, low confidence)
mateng = (i:1) (t:conj) (w:until/til/till) (d:placed after a verb: up to the time when something happens)
mateng = (i:2) (t:ppm) (d:postpositional marker indicating a certain span of time or distance, equivalent in usage to the prepositions up to, as far as, to)
