mawksut = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rob/plunder/exploit) (d:<mawk>, without cause, with <sut> plunder) (q:draft)
mawktai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:run aimlessly) (d:<mawk>, without aim, with <tai> run) (q:draft)
mawktatna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:folly/reckless living/self-indulgence) (d:<mawk> carelessly with <tat> behave and the noun suffix <na>) (q:draft, low confidence)
mawkte = (i:1) (t:n) (d:<mawk> idly or of itself, with plural <te>: closes a clause to mean those who do so idly or for no cause, as {a ding mawkte}, those standing idle) (b:mawk) (q:draft)
