mawl = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:dull/blunt/senseless) (d:of a blade, not sharp; of the heart or mind, slow to understand, as in {lungsim mawl}, a dull or senseless heart) (s:hai) (a:pil/hiam) (q:draft)
