Moreth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Moreh) (d:spelling of <Moreh>, the place of the great tree at Shechem to which Abram came) (r:1.12.6)
Moriah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Moriah) (d:region where Abraham was sent to offer Isaac; also the mount in Jerusalem on which Solomon built the temple) (r:1.22.2)
Mose = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Moses) (d:Moses, who led Israel out of Egypt, written without its final s before the possessive apostrophe, as in {Mose’ kiangah}, to Moses) (r:2.10.12) (q:draft)
Moserah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Moserah) (d:place in the wilderness where Aaron died and was buried) (r:5.10.6)
Moseroth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Moseroth) (d:camping place of the Israelites in the wilderness) (r:4.33.30/4.33.31)
