motpau = (i:1) (t:v) (w:talk idly/speak idle words) (d:<mot>, idly, with <pau>, speak: talk idly or foolishly) (q:draft)
Moza = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Moza) (d:name of two men, a son of Caleb by his concubine Ephah and a descendant of King Saul) (r:13.9.43/13.2.46) (q:draft)
Mozah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Mozah) (d:town in the territory of Benjamin) (r:6.18.26)
mu = (i:2) (t:v) (w:detect) (d:notice or discover something)
mu-meika = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (w:kite/red kite) (d:a bird of prey in the lists of unclean birds, also written <mumeika>) (s:mumeika) (q:draft)
mua = (t:see) <mua-mua>
mua-mua = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:teeming/swarming) (d:descriptive word for countless creatures moving about together; in the verse with <na>, the place where they teem) (s:muamua) (q:draft, low confidence)
muaimuai = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:in a mass/in swarms/in great numbers) (d:placed after a verb of movement, of a great crowd or swarm moving together) (s:muamua) (q:draft)
