nenniamna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:oppression/tyranny) (d:<nenniam>, oppress, with the noun suffix <na>: cruel and unjust treatment by those in power; {nenniamna thuak} is suffer oppression) (s:netniamna/sukcipna) (b:nenniam) (r:23.53.8) (q:draft)
nenniamnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:oppressions/acts of oppression) (d:<nenniamna> oppression, with the plural <te>) (s:netniamnate) (b:nenniamna) (q:draft)
nensakin = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:into pieces) (d:<nen> into small pieces with causative <sak> and the linking suffix <in>; {sem nensakin}, having it cut into pieces) (b:nen) (q:draft)
nente = (i:1) (t:n) (w:pieces) (d:<nen> small pieces with plural <te>; {a ki-at nente}, the pieces that were cut) (b:nen) (q:draft)
