Neriah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Neriah) (d:son of Mahseiah and father of Baruch, the scribe of Jeremiah, and of Seraiah) (r:24.32.16/24.36.8)
nesak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:feed/give to eat/make eat/let eat) (d:<ne> eat with the causative <sak>: give someone something to eat, make someone eat, or allow someone to eat) (s:neksak) (b:ne) (r:24.19.9) (q:draft)
