Nethaniah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Nethaniah) (d:name of several men, among them the father of Ishmael who killed Gedaliah, a son of Asaph, and the father of Jehudi) (r:24.41.15/24.41.12)
Nethanniah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Nethaniah) (d:spelling of Nethaniah in this verse, the father of Ishmael who killed Gedaliah) (r:24.41.9)
