netniamna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:oppression) (d:<netniam>, oppress, with the noun suffix <na>: the act of oppressing or the state of being oppressed; {netniamna thuak} is suffer oppression) (s:nenniamna/kinetniamna) (b:netniam) (q:draft)
netniamnate = (i:1) (t:n) (w:oppressions) (d:<netniamna> oppression with plural <te>) (s:nenniamnate) (b:netniamna) (q:draft)
