netum = (i:1) (t:v) (w:devour/eat up/consume) (d:<ne> eat with <tum>, wholly: eat something completely, said of animals, of enemies and of anything that consumes a person) (s:nektum/nemang/valhtum) (r:1.41.4) (q:draft)
