neu = (i:3) (t:adj) (w:mini) as in products
neu = (i:4) (t:adj) (w:little) (d:small in degree or importance, as little faith or a small matter) (a:lian)
neu = (i:5) (t:adj) (w:sloping/narrow) (d:too small in width or room: narrow, of a road or a blanket; cramped, of a place to live) (s:kawcik) (a:zai)
neubawl = (i:1) (t:v) (w:make small/bring low) (d:<neu> small with <bawl> make; reduce to nothing) (s:neusak) (b:neu) (q:draft, low confidence)
