neulai = (i:1) (t:n) (w:youth/childhood) (d:the time when a person is small or young: <neu>, small, with <lai>, the time when; {neulai a kipan} is from youth on) (s:neutung/neucil/khangnolai) (a:khanghamna) (q:draft)
neulua = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:too small) (d:<neu>, small, with <lua>, too much: too small for what is needed or for the people who use it) (a:lianlua) (b:neu) (q:draft)
