neuneute = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:small/minor/trivial) (d:<neuneu>, small, said of several things, with the plural <te>; {thu neuneute} are small matters) (a:liante) (b:neuneu) (q:draft)
neuno = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:small/little/tiny) (d:<neu>, small, with the diminutive <no>: small or slight; {na neuno khat} is a small thing or a small request) (a:lian/gol) (b:neu) (q:draft)
