neuzaw = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:smaller/lesser/inferior) (d:<neu>, small, with <zaw>, more: smaller or lesser than another, also lower in rank; what it is compared with is followed by <sangin>, than) (a:lianzaw/golzaw) (b:neu)
neuzawte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:lesser ones/smaller ones/the least) (d:<neuzaw> smaller, lesser, with the plural <te>: those who are lesser in rank or strength) (a:lianzawte/golzawte) (b:neuzaw) (q:draft)
