ngasak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:make face/turn toward/lay on) (d:<nga>, face or be turned toward, with the causative <sak>: make a thing face a direction; of hands, lay them on someone) (s:ngatsak/ngaksak) (b:nga) (q:draft)
