ngawngah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:on the neck/around the neck) (d:<ngawng>, neck, with the place marker <ah>: on or around the neck, said of a yoke, a chain or a millstone) (s:ngawngzangah) (b:ngawng) (q:draft)
ngawngin = (i:1) (t:n) (w:by the neck) (d:<ngawng>, neck, with the marker <in>: by the neck; {ngawngin man} is seize by the neck) (b:ngawng) (q:draft)
ngawngkawi = (t:see) <ngawngkawi-in>
ngawngkawi-in = (i:1) (t:v) (w:embracing/hugging/throwing the arms around) (d:<ngawng>, neck, with <kawi>, embrace, and the linking suffix <in>: putting the arms around the neck of someone) (q:draft)
ngawngzangah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:on the neck) (d:{ngawngzang}, the neck or nape, with the place marker <ah>: on the neck, said of a yoke or load) (s:ngawngah) (q:draft)
