petthei = (i:1) (t:v) (w:can bite/biting) (d:<pet> bite with <thei> can) (b:pet) (q:draft)
peu = (t:todo) (q:draft, single verse about a faulty bow, {thal peu tel}; the part this word plays is not clear)
peuh = (i:1) (t:det) (w:any/whatever/every) (d:placed after a noun or a verb clause, any at all, whatever, wherever) (s:peuhpeuh) (q:draft)
