phial = (i:1) (t:part) (w:even if/even though) (d:word placed after the verb in a clause of supposition, followed by {ahi zongin} or {mah leng zong}: even if it really were so) (q:draft)
phial = (i:2) (t:adv) (w:even/really/quite) (d:after a verb or a word of likeness or amount, stressing that it goes as far as that: {kibang phial}, be quite like, {zah phial}, even as much as) (q:draft, low confidence)
phial = (i:3) (t:v) (w:confuse/throw into confusion) (d:in {phial gawp}, throw an army into complete disorder) (q:draft, low confidence)
