phialun = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:almost/nearly) (d:after a word of amount, all but that much: {a khuazang phialun}, almost the whole town; <phial> with the ending <un>) (s:dektak) (q:draft, low confidence)
phiangsiah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:tax/tribute/revenue) (d:payment owed to a ruler or government) (s:siah) (q:draft)
