phiat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:erase/blot out/wipe out) (d:wipe something away so that nothing is left of it, as a name from a book or from memory)
phiat = (i:2) (t:v) (w:sweep/sweep away) (d:sweep with a broom; with <khia>, out, sweep people or a house away)
phiat = (i:3) (t:n) (w:wipe)
