phiatmai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:blot out/wipe out/destroy) (d:<phiat>, erase, with <mai>, so that nothing is left: remove a name from a book, raze a city) (s:phiatmang/maimangsak) (q:draft)
phiatmang = (i:1) (t:v) (w:blot out/wipe away) (d:<phiat> wipe with <mang>, away) (s:phiatmai/phiatkhia) (q:draft)
phiatmangsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:blot out/wipe away) (d:<phiatmang> wipe away with <sak>, do it for another) (s:phiatkhiatsak) (b:phiatmang) (q:draft)
phiatna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:flashing) (d:in {khua phiatna mun}, the place where the lightning flashed; from <phia> flash, not from <phiat> wipe) (s:khuaphiatna) (q:draft, low confidence)
phiatsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:wiped out/abolished/done away with) (d:<phiat> wipe with <sa>, already done) (b:phiat) (q:draft)
