phiatsak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:make flash) (d:in {khua a phiatsak}, said of God making the lightning flash from the cloud; probably from <phia> flash, not from <phiat> wipe) (s:phiasak) (q:draft, low confidence)
phiatsakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:making flash) (d:<phiatsak> with the noun suffix <na>, in {khua a phiatsakna}, his making the lightning flash) (b:phiatsak) (q:draft, low confidence)
phiatsiang = (i:1) (t:v) (w:wipe out/sweep away/remove completely) (d:<phiat> sweep, wipe, with <siang> clean: sweep clean away) (s:phiatkhiamang) (b:phiat) (q:draft)
