Ram = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ram) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Hezron of Judah, ancestor of David) (r:8.4.19/13.2.9) (q:draft)
Rama = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ramah) (d:Ramah, town of Benjamin north of Jerusalem) (q:draft)
Ramah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ramah) (d:name of several towns, among them one in Benjamin and the home town of Samuel) (r:6.19.36/16.11.33)
