Ramathmizpeh = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Ramath Mizpah) (d:place on the border of the territory of Gad east of the Jordan) (r:6.13.26)
Rameses = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male/land) (w:Rameses) (d:district and city in Egypt where the family of Jacob settled and from which the Israelites set out) (r:1.47.11/2.12.37)
Ramiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ramiah) (d:Israelite of the family of Parosh who had married a foreign wife) (r:15.10.25)
Rammah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ramah) (d:Ramah, the home town of Samuel) (r:9.19.22)
Ramoth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ramoth) (d:name of several towns, among them Ramoth in Gilead and Ramoth in the Negev) (r:5.4.43/9.30.27)
Ramoth-gilead = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ramoth Gilead) (d:city in Gilead east of the Jordan, fought over by Israel and Aram) (r:11.22.29) (q:draft)
Ramothgilead = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place/city) (w:Ramoth Gilead) (d:city in Gilead east of the Jordan, fought over by Israel and Aram) (r:14.18.28/14.18.11)
Re = (t:see) <Re-u>
