Reba = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Reba) (d:one of the five kings of Midian killed by the Israelites) (r:4.31.8/6.13.21)
Rebekah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:female) (w:Rebekah) (d:wife of Isaac, mother of Esau and Jacob) (r:1.25.20/45.9.10)
Rebon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rehob) (d:Rehob, town in the territory of Asher whose people were not driven out) (r:7.1.31)
Reelaiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Reelaiah) (d:one of the leaders who returned from exile with Zerubbabel) (r:15.2.2)
