Refaiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rephaiah) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Hur who helped repair the wall of Jerusalem) (r:16.3.9/13.3.21)
Refaim = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land/valley) (w:Rephaim) (d:valley near Jerusalem where David defeated the Philistines) (r:13.14.9/10.5.18)
