Refidim = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rephidim) (d:camping place of the Israelites in the wilderness, where they fought the Amalekites) (r:2.17.1/4.33.15)
Regem = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Regem) (d:descendant of Caleb, son of Jahdai) (r:13.2.47)
Regemmelek = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Regem-Melek) (d:man sent from Bethel to ask the priests and prophets about fasting) (r:38.7.2)
