Reubente = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (w:Reuben/Reubenites) (d:<Reuben> with the plural <te>: the Reubenites, the tribe descended from Reuben) (b:Reuben) (r:2.6.14)
Reuel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Reuel) (d:name of several men, among them a son of Esau and Basemath) (r:1.36.4/13.9.8)
Reumah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male/female) (w:Reumah) (d:concubine of Nahor, the brother of Abraham) (r:1.22.24)
Rezef = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rezeph) (d:city conquered by the Assyrians, named in the message of Sennacherib to Hezekiah) (r:12.19.12/23.37.12)
Rezen = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rezin) (d:Rezin, king of Aram) (r:23.9.11)
