Rezon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rezon) (d:son of Eliada, ruler in Damascus and adversary of Solomon) (r:11.11.23)
Ribai = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ribai) (d:man of Gibeah in Benjamin, father of Ithai, one of the mighty warriors of David) (r:10.23.29/13.11.31)
Riblah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Riblah) (d:city in the land of Hamath where the king of Babylon had his headquarters) (r:24.52.26/12.25.20)
Ribnah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Libnah) (d:Libnah, a camping place of the Israelites in the wilderness) (r:4.33.21)
Rifath = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Riphath) (d:son of Gomer, grandson of Japheth) (r:1.10.3)
Rimmon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land/city) (w:Rimmon) (d:town in the south of Judah, given to the tribe of Simeon) (r:6.19.7/13.4.32)
