rish = (t:see) <Kushan-rish-athaim>
Rissah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rissah) (d:place where the Israelites camped in the wilderness, between Libnah and Kehelathah) (r:4.33.21/4.33.22)
Rithmah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rithmah) (d:place where the Israelites camped in the wilderness after leaving Hazeroth) (r:4.33.18/4.33.19)
Rizia = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rizia) (d:son of Ulla, of the tribe of Asher) (r:13.7.39)
