Rodes = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Rhodes) (d:island off the south-west coast of Asia Minor, where Paul’s ship called; its people traded with Tyre) (r:44.21.1/26.27.15)
Rods = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (w:Rhodes) (d:another spelling of <Rodes>, the island of Rhodes off the south-west coast of Asia Minor) (r:26.27.15/44.21.1)
Rogelim = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Rogelim) (d:town in Gilead, home of Barzillai who helped David) (r:10.17.27/10.19.31)
Rohgah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rohgah) (d:son of Shomer, of the tribe of Asher) (r:13.7.34)
