sapna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:calling/call/summons) (d:<sap>, call, with the noun suffix <na>: the act of calling, a call or summons; of God, his calling of people) (b:sap) (q:draft)
sapna = (i:2) (t:n) (w:need/lack) (d:what someone lacks or requires; {sapna nei lo} is to lack nothing) (s:kisapna/tangsapna/kitangsapna) (q:draft)
