sikkeu = (i:1) (t:n) (w:fork/meat fork/fleshhook) (d:an iron fork for lifting meat from the pot; {sikkeu-ka-thum} is a three-pronged fork) (s:sikkeuka) (q:draft)
sikkeuka = (i:1) (t:n) (w:fork/fleshhook) (d:<sikkeu>, iron fork, with <ka>, prong: a pronged fork for lifting meat from the pot) (s:sikkeu) (q:draft, low confidence)
