sikli = (i:1) (t:n) (w:square/four corners) (d:a shape with four corners; {sikli nei} is having four corners, square; of woven cloth, a checkered pattern) (q:draft)
siklong = (i:1) (t:n) (w:bell) (d:a small metal bell; {kham siklong} are the gold bells on the hem of the robe of the priest) (s:long) (q:draft)
