siklum = (i:1) (t:n) (w:anchor) (d:the anchor of a ship; used as a picture of hope that holds the soul firm) (s:sikkawipi/sikkawi) (q:draft)
sikna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:footstool/foothold/place trodden) (d:<sik> tread, with the noun suffix <na>: the place where the foot is set; {khe sikna} is a footstool or foothold) (s:khengakna/khesikna) (b:sik) (q:draft)
siknazat = (i:1) (t:n) (w:iron tool) (d:<sik> iron, with <nazat> tool) (q:draft)
