sikpeek = (i:1) (t:n) (w:iron plate/iron pan) (d:<sik>, iron, and <peek>, flat piece: a flat sheet of iron) (q:draft)
sikpuan = (i:1) (t:n) (w:coat of armor/coat of mail/armor) (d:<sik>, iron, with <puan>, garment: armor worn on the body in battle; {sikpuan silh} is put on armor) (q:draft)
