siksanin = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:on the basis of/based on/according to/from) (d:<siksan> with the suffix {-in}: taking something as the ground or support for what is said or done) (b:siksan) (q:draft)
siksankha = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rely on/judge by) (d:<siksan> rely on, with <kha> happen to; end up going by) (q:draft, low confidence)
