siksekpa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:blacksmith/smith/metalworker) (d:<sik>, iron, with <sek>, forge, and <pa> for a man: a man who works metal, also of a silversmith) (s:seekpa) (b:siksek) (q:draft)
siksuk = (i:1) (t:v) (w:tread down on/tread upon) (d:<sik>, tread, with <suk>, downward) (b:sik) (q:draft)
