Silngo = (i:1) (t:n) (w:yeast/leaven) (d:<silngo>, yeast, written with a capital at the start of a sentence and in the festival name {Silngo Sawh loh Anlum Pawi}, the Festival of Unleavened Bread) (b:silngo) (q:draft)
