siluangte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:corpses/dead bodies) (d:<siluang>, corpse, with plural <te>) (s:luanghawmte/Misiluangte) (b:siluang) (q:draft)
Silvanas = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Silas/Silvanus) (d:companion of Paul on his journeys and co-sender of the letters to the Thessalonians, also named by Peter; called Silas in Acts) (r:53.1.1/47.1.19)
