suite = (i:1) (t:n) (w:cutters/hewers) (d:<sui> cut with the plural <te>, those who cut; {sing suite} are woodcutters) (s:phukte) (b:sui) (q:draft)
suk = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:into/down) (d:placed after a verb to show movement downward or down into something)
suk = (i:2) (t:adj) (w:downhill/downward) (d:going down toward a lower place; set against <to>, upward)
sukah = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:along/down along) (d:<suk> downward, with the place marker <ah>, down the length of something, as in {nawl dung sukah} along the edge) (s:dungah) (b:suk) (q:draft, low confidence)
