sukgawpsa = (i:1) (t:v) (w:crushed/destroyed/ravaged) (d:<sukgawp> strike down with <sa>, already done; placed before the thing or person struck) (b:sukgawp) (q:draft)
sukha = (i:1) (t:v) (w:touch/harm/affect) (d:come against a person or thing: touch it, and so harm or affect it) (s:lawngkha) (r:18.35.6) (q:draft)
