sukham = (i:1) (t:v) (w:break/smash/shatter/crush) (d:break something hard to pieces by force, as a jar, stone tablets, altars or idols) (s:satkham) (r:19.74.13) (q:draft)
sukhamin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:breaking/smashing/breaking in pieces) (d:<sukham>, break to pieces, with the linking ending <in>, joining it to the next verb) (s:satkhamin) (b:sukham) (q:draft)
