sukkhak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:touch/press against) (d:come into contact with; form of {su kha} used before <ding>, <loh>, <an> and the like) (s:lawngkha/sukha) (q:draft)
sukkhak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:harm/damage) (d:do harm or damage to someone or something; form of {su kha} used before <ding>) (q:draft, low confidence)
