sumpi = (i:1) (t:n) (w:collection/offering/fund) (d:money given or collected for a common purpose, such as an offering or a collection for the poor; {sumpi khiatna} is the giving of an offering and {sumpi keempa} is a steward) (b:sum) (q:draft, low confidence)
sumsan = (i:1) (t:n) (w:copper/bronze) (d:<sum>, metal, with <san>, red: copper, or bronze made from it) (s:sumngo) (q:draft)
