sumsungte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:silversmiths/craftsmen/metalworkers) (d:those who cast silver or metal, plural; {sum sungpa} is a silversmith) (q:draft)
sumtang = (i:1) (t:n) (w:coin) (d:a piece of metal money; {sumtang peek khat} is one coin) (s:dangka/sumnen) (q:draft)
sumte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:money/possessions/riches) (d:<sum>, money, with the plural <te>: sums of money, and also the goods and riches a person owns) (s:dangkate/neihsate) (b:sum) (q:draft)
sumteng = (i:1) (t:n) (w:all the money/money) (d:<sum> money with <teng>, all of it) (b:sum) (q:draft)
