sumzuakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:trade/market/selling) (d:selling of goods, trading; {sumzuakna inn} is a market house, <sumlei sumzuakna> is buying and selling) (s:zuakna) (a:sumleina) (b:sumzuak) (q:draft)
sumzuakte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:sellers) (d:<sumzuak> sell with the plural <te>, those who sell) (s:zuakte) (a:sumleite) (b:sumzuak) (q:draft)
Sun = (i:1) (t:n) (w:day/daytime) (d:<sun>, day, written with a capital at the start of a sentence or as a name: the light part of the day, the opposite of <zan>, night) (a:Zan) (b:sun) (q:draft)
sung = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:in) (d:the inside of something: placed after a noun for in or inside it; with other markers it forms <sungah>, in, and {sung panin}, out of)
sung = (i:2) (t:prep) (w:during) (d:placed after a word of time: for or during that length of time) (r:1.7.24)
