sunga = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:in) (d:<sung>, inside, with the linking <a>: that is in, placed between a noun and what is found inside it) (b:sung)
sunga = (i:2) (t:prep) (w:within) (b:sung)
sungah = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:inside) (b:sung)
