sungin = (i:2) (t:part) (d:word combined with a noun to indicating a time or period thah) (b:sung)
sunginah = (i:1) (t:prep) (w:within/in) (d:<sungin> within a period with <ah>; {nai khat sunginah} is within one hour) (b:sungin) (q:draft)
sungkhia = (i:1) (t:v) (w:pour out) (d:<sung>, pour, with <khia>, out: of water, blood or a drink offering, and of the heart poured out before God) (s:buakhia) (b:sung) (q:draft)
