sungnu = (i:1) (t:n) (w:mother-in-law) (d:the mother of a man's wife; <nu> marks a woman) (q:draft)
sungnung = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:inner/inmost) (d:placed after a noun, as in {biakinntual sungnung} the inner court) (a:puanung) (q:draft)
sungnung = (i:2) (t:n) (w:inner room/inner sanctuary) (d:the innermost room of the temple) (q:draft)
