sunlet = (i:1) (t:v) (w:pierce/pierce through/penetrate) (d:<sun>, stab, with <let>, through: pierce right through, as hands, armour or an enemy) (s:sunkham/dawt) (q:draft)
sunletgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (w:pierce through/strike down) (d:<sunlet> pierce through with <gawp>, which shows that the action is done thoroughly or violently) (b:sunlet) (q:draft, low confidence)
