taangkhawm = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shine together/shine with) (d:<taang>, shine, with <khawm>, together) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangkhia = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shine forth/shine out/flash) (d:<taang> shine with <khia>, out) (s:taankhiat) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangkhiasak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shine out/give out light/radiate) (d:<taangkhia>, shine out, with <sak>, cause) (b:taangkhia) (q:draft)
taangkhiasak = (i:2) (t:v) (w:stretch out/put forth) (d:of the hand, {khut taangkhiasak}: reach out the hand to strike) (q:draft, low confidence)
taangkim = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be fully lit/shine all over) (d:<taang>, shine, with <kim>, complete: be bright in every part) (q:draft)
taangko = (i:1) (t:v) (w:proclaim/announce/declare) (d:make known publicly and aloud; {va taangko in} is go and proclaim) (s:tangko/genkhia/pulak/zasak) (q:draft)
taangkona = (i:1) (t:n) (w:proclamation/announcement/decree) (d:a public announcement made aloud through a land; {taangkona bawl} is make a proclamation) (s:tangkona) (b:taangko) (q:draft)
taangkosak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:have proclaimed/cause to proclaim) (d:<taangko> proclaim with <sak>, cause) (b:taangko) (q:draft)
taanglai = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:ancient/of old) (d:placed before a noun: of long ago) (s:khanglui) (a:thak) (q:draft)
taanglai = (i:2) (t:n) (w:ancient times/long ago) (d:the far past, as {taanglai pek panin}, from long ago) (s:tanglai/taangtawng/tangtawng/hunlui) (q:draft)
taanglua = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be very bright/be too bright) (d:<taang> shine with <lua>, exceedingly; also the great brightness of a light) (s:taanlua) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangmi = (i:1) (t:n) (w:ambassador/envoy/messenger) (d:a person sent to speak for a king or for another) (s:tangmi/palai/kamtai) (r:49.6.20) (q:draft)
taangmite = (i:1) (t:n) (w:envoys/ambassadors/messengers) (d:plural of <taangmi>) (s:tangmite/kamtaite) (b:taangmi) (q:draft)
taangsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:make shine/cause to shine) (d:<taang> shine with the causative <sak>; {mai taangsak} is to make the face shine on someone, to show favour) (s:tangsak) (a:mialsak) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangsakin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:making shine) (d:<taangsak>, make shine, with the linking suffix <in>; {maitang taangsak} is to make the face shine on someone) (b:taangsak) (q:draft)
taangtawng = (i:1) (t:n) (w:ancient times/long ago/of old) (d:the far past; {taangtawng pek} is from of old, {taangtawng lai-a} is in ancient times) (s:tangtawng/taanglai/tanglai/hunlui) (q:draft)
taangte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:wheat/grain) (d:<taang> with plural <te>, the wheat plants) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangte = (i:2) (t:n) (w:lights/brightness) (d:the shining of lamps or stars) (b:taang) (q:draft)
taangtun = (i:1) (t:v) (w:accomplish/achieve) (d:bring to completion; apparently another spelling of <tangtun>) (s:tangtun) (q:draft, low confidence)
taangtung = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be established/succeed) (d:of work or plans, be carried through; apparently another spelling of <tangtung>) (s:tangtung) (q:draft)
taangzah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:brightness/amount of light) (d:<taang>, shine, with <zah>, amount: as much light as) (q:draft, low confidence)
taangzaih = (i:1) (t:v) (w:flash/shine around/blaze) (d:of a bright light, shine out suddenly all around) (s:taanzaih) (q:draft)
