taankhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shine out/shine forth) (d:<taan> shine with <khiat>, out) (s:taangkhia) (b:taan) (q:draft)
taankhiatna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:brightness/shining forth) (d:<taankhiat>, shine out, with the noun suffix <na>) (b:taankhiat) (q:draft)
taanlawh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:lose/forfeit/be deprived of) (d:no longer have something, said of life and of good things) (s:taan) (a:ngah) (q:draft)
taanlawhte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:those who lose) (d:<taanlawh> lose with the plural <te>) (b:taanlawh) (r:40.10.39) (q:draft)
taanlua = (i:1) (t:v) (w:shine too brightly/be too bright) (d:<taan>, shine, with <lua>, too much) (s:taanglua) (b:taan) (q:draft)
