Tabeel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Tabeel) (d:name of two men: the father of the man whom Aram and Israel planned to make king of Judah, and an official who wrote to King Artaxerxes) (r:23.7.6/15.4.7)
Taber = (i:1) (t:name) (c:mountain) (w:Tabor) (d:spelling of <Tabor>, a mountain in Galilee, in Jeremiah 46.18) (q:draft)
