tabor = (t:see) <Khisloth-tabor>
Tabor = (i:1) (t:name) (c:mountain) (w:Tabor) (d:mountain in Galilee at the edge of the Jezreel plain, where Barak gathered his army) (r:7.4.12) (q:draft)
Tabor = (i:2) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Tabor) (d:Levite town from the territory of Zebulun; also a point on the boundary of Issachar) (r:13.6.77/6.19.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
