Tahash = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Tahash) (d:son of Nahor by his concubine Reumah) (r:1.22.24)
Tahath = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male/place) (w:Tahath) (d:name of a camping place of Israel in the wilderness and of several men, among them a Levite descended from Korah) (r:4.33.27/13.6.37)
tahen = (i:1) (t:part) (w:may/let) (d:sentence-final word expressing a wish or blessing, from <ta> and <hen> and also written {ta hen}: may it be, let it be) (q:draft)
