tahtah = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:pressed down/shaken together) (d:one of three words describing a full measure, {a henhen, a tahtah, a dimletin}; which English term it matches is not certain) (q:draft, low confidence)
tahtan = (i:1) (t:v) (w:break/chip) (d:of teeth, break against something hard; used with <sak>, cause to break) (q:draft, low confidence)
