Taia = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (w:Tyre) (d:ancient Phoenician port city on the Mediterranean coast north of Israel, home of King Hiram) (r:26.27.2/6.19.29)
taigawp = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rebuke/scold severely) (d:<tai>, rebuke, with <gawp>, severely) (s:taii/taai/taiibawl) (a:phat) (q:draft)
