taii = (i:2) (t:adj) (w:cheerful/bright) (d:of the face, in {mai taii-na}, a cheerful face) (s:maitai/lungtaii) (a:maigum) (q:draft, low confidence)
taiibawl = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rebuke/denounce/scold) (d:<taii> rebuke with <bawl> do: treat someone with harsh rebuke) (s:taii/taai/taigawp) (a:phat) (b:taii) (q:draft)
