taikeek = (i:1) (t:v) (w:flee/run away/scatter in flight) (d:run away from an enemy, scattering in all directions) (s:taimang/taikhia/taikek) (a:delh) (q:draft)
taikeeksak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:rout/put to flight) (d:<taikeek>, flee scattering, with the causative <sak>) (s:taisak/taimangsak) (b:taikeek) (q:draft)
taikek = (i:1) (t:v) (w:flee/run away in haste) (d:run away from an enemy in fear; apparently another spelling of <taikeek>) (s:taikeek/taimang) (q:draft)
