Talmon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Talmon) (d:a Levite gatekeeper, head of a family of gatekeepers that returned from the exile) (r:13.9.17/16.11.19)
talsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:let slip/cause to slip) (d:of the foot, let it slide; apparently <taal>, slip, with the causative <sak>) (s:taalsak) (q:draft)
talsuan = (i:1) (t:n) (w:frontlet/phylactery) (d:a sign or small case of scripture worn on the forehead between the eyes) (q:draft)
