tamkimlo = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:uneven/rough) (d:<tamkim>, level, with the negative <lo>) (a:tamkim) (b:tamkim) (q:draft)
tamlai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:stay/remain) (d:stay on in a place for a time; apparently <taam>, stay, with <lai>, still) (s:taam) (q:draft, low confidence)
tamlawh = (i:1) (t:v) (w:lament/mourn/sing a lament) (d:mourn someone or something aloud in words or song) (s:thuum) (q:draft)
