tampite = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:many/numerous) (d:many, with the plural marker <te>, placed after the noun it counts) (s:tampi/tamte) (a:tawmte/tawmnote) (b:tampi) (q:draft)
tamsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:multiply/increase/make numerous/make plentiful) (d:<tam>, many, with the causative <sak>: make many, increase the number of people or things) (s:pungsak/phasak/khangsak) (a:tawmsak/kiamsak) (b:tam) (q:draft)
tamsakin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:multiply/make numerous) (d:<tamsak>, make many, with the linking ending <in>: making numerous, and then) (b:tamsak) (q:draft)
tamsakin = (i:2) (t:v) (w:name after) (d:in {min tamsakin}, from {min tam}, bear the name of someone, with <sak>, cause: giving a place a person's own name) (q:draft, low confidence)
