tamveipi = (i:1) (t:adv) (w:often/many times/frequently) (d:<tamvei>, many times, with the intensive <pi>: very often, time and again) (s:tamvei/zelzel/veipi) (b:tamvei) (q:draft)
tamzawk = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:more/greater) (d:form of <tamzaw>, more, used before a following word) (b:tamzaw) (q:draft)
