Tarshis = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Tarshish) (d:spelling of Tarshish used in the Psalms: a distant land or seaport known for its large trading ships) (r:19.48.7) (q:draft)
Tarshish = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male/place) (w:Tarshish) (d:son of Javan; also a distant seaport known for its trading ships, and the name of a Benjaminite and of a Persian noble) (r:1.10.4)
