thahnopna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:desire to kill/bloodthirstiness) (d:<thah>, kill, with <nop>, want, and <na>: the wish to kill someone) (b:thahnop) (q:draft)
thahsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (w:killed/slain) (d:<thah>, kill, with <sa>, already done: whom someone has killed; placed before the noun) (s:kithatsa) (b:thah) (q:draft)
thahsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:have killed/kill/slay) (d:<thah>, form of <that>, kill, with <sak>: kill, or cause someone to be killed) (s:thatsak/thatlumsak/thahlupsak) (b:thah) (q:draft)
thahsakna = (i:1) (t:n) (w:having killed/putting to death) (d:<thahsak> cause to be killed with the noun suffix <na>: the fact of having had someone killed) (b:thahsak) (q:draft)
thahsawm = (i:1) (t:v) (w:plot to kill/plan to kill) (d:<thah> kill with <sawm> plan, intend) (q:draft)
