theikik = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be able again/can again) (d:<thei>, be able, with <kik>, again; {khua mu theikik} is be able to see again, regain sight) (b:thei) (q:draft)
theikim = (i:1) (t:v) (w:all know/know fully) (d:<thei> know with <kim> all: said of everyone knowing a thing, or of knowing the whole of it) (q:draft)
