vulkik = (i:1) (t:v) (w:wither away/wither) (d:<vul>, wither, with <kik>, back: of a plant that has come up, wither and die back) (b:vul) (r:18.24.24) (q:draft)
vulpak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:wither soon/wither quickly) (d:<vul>, wither, with <pak>, quickly) (q:draft)
vulsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:make wither/blight) (d:<vul>, wither, with the causative <sak>: cause plants to wither; {mai vulsak} is make the face look drawn and gloomy) (b:vul) (q:draft)
vum = (i:1) (t:v) (w:be piled up/be heaped) (d:lie in a heap; {vum venvan} is piled high) (q:draft, low confidence)
vumah = (i:1) (t:n) (w:on top/on the roof) (d:<vum>, top, with <ah>, at or on: {innkhum vumah} is on the housetops) (q:draft)
