vunte = (i:1) (t:n) (w:skins/hides) (d:<vun>, skin, with the plural <te>: skins of animals, used as coverings) (s:savunte) (b:vun) (r:3.9.11/2.35.7) (q:draft)
vut = (i:1) (t:n) (w:ashes/ash) (d:the grey powder left after something is burned; sitting in ashes or putting them on the head is a sign of grief or repentance) (s:vu) (q:draft)
vut = (i:2) (t:v) (w:pierce/prick) (d:pierce or bore through; of the heart, be cut or pierced by pain; of the ears, tingle at shocking news) (s:vuhsak/sunlet) (r:9.3.11) (q:draft)
