Za-avan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zaavan) (d:son of Ezer and grandson of Seir the Horite, in the land of Edom) (r:13.1.42) (q:draft)
zaa = (i:1) (t:n) (w:office/commission/rank) (d:spelling with a long vowel of <za>, title or rank: the office given to a person) (b:za) (q:draft, low confidence)
zaai = (i:1) (t:v) (w:spread out/spread wide) (d:of branches, spread out wide; a spelling with a long vowel of <zai>, wide) (q:draft)
