zemin = (i:1) (t:v) (w:adorning/decorating/dressing/painting) (d:<zem>, decorate or adorn, with the linking marker <in>; of a person, dressing in fine clothes, and of the eyes, putting on paint) (s:zeemin) (b:zem) (q:draft)
