zemsak = (i:1) (t:v) (w:robe/dress/adorn) (d:<zem>, decorate, with the causative <sak>: dress another person in fine clothes) (s:zeemsak) (b:zem) (q:draft)
zen = (i:1) (t:part) (w:really/even) (d:emphatic word placed after a verb: really, even, to such a degree) (q:draft, low confidence)
