Zerahiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zerahiah) (d:a priest descended from Aaron, son of Uzzi and father of Meraioth) (r:13.6.6/15.7.4)
Zerahte = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (w:Zerahites) (d:the clan of Judah descended from Zerah, to which Achan belonged) (b:Zerah) (r:6.7.17)
Zeran = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zerah) (d:spelling of Zerah, son of Judah, in 1 Chronicles 2:6) (r:13.2.6)
Zered = (i:1) (t:name) (c:valley) (w:Zered) (d:valley and stream on the border of Moab, crossed by Israel at the end of the years in the wilderness) (r:4.21.12)
