Zereth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zereth) (d:son of Ashhur and Helah in the genealogy of Judah; also the first part of the place name Zereth Shahar) (r:6.13.19/13.4.7)
Zereth-shahar = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Zereth Shahar) (d:town of Reuben on a hill in the valley, east of the Dead Sea) (q:draft)
Zerethan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (w:Zarethan) (d:town in the Jordan valley near Adam, where the waters stood still when Israel crossed) (r:6.3.16)
Zeri = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zeri) (d:son of Jeduthun, a temple musician in the time of David) (r:13.25.3)
Zeror = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zeror) (d:a Benjamite, grandfather of Kish and ancestor of King Saul) (r:9.9.1)
