Zeruah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:female) (w:Zeruah) (d:a widow, mother of Jeroboam son of Nebat) (r:11.11.26)
Zerubbabel = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zerubbabel) (d:governor of Judah after the exile, of the line of David, who led the return from Babylon and rebuilt the temple) (r:40.1.13/37.2.21)
Zeruiah = (i:1) (t:name) (c:female) (w:Zeruiah) (d:sister of David, mother of Joab, Abishai and Asahel) (r:10.8.16)
Zetham = (i:1) (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zetham) (d:a Levite of the family of Gershon, in charge of the treasuries of the temple) (r:13.23.8/13.26.22)
